# The network file of tests/app/play.sh's build (decision 0025): the play
# application's frames channel and its keys channel both switched off (port
# 0), so the M33's network firmware opens no socket for either. The
# addresses are documentation ones (RFC 5737); a run that plays is given its
# own file, outside the repository.
interface swp0
address dhcp
netmask dhcp
channel frames 192.0.2.1 0
inbound keys 0 from 192.0.2.1
